<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<style>
    .legal-page {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 55px auto;
        padding: 45px 55px;
        background-color: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #eee;
        border-radius: 18px;
        box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    .legal-page h1 {
        font-size: 2.7rem;
        font-weight: 650;
        color: #fe424d;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .legal-page .last-updated {
        color: #888;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .legal-page h2 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #222;
        margin-top: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .legal-page p {
        color: #555;

        font-size: 1.02rem;
        line-height: 1.8;


        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .legal-page {

            margin: 25px 12px;
            padding: 25px 20px;
        }

        .legal-page h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

    }

    /* mobile and tab */
    /* TABLET STYLING */
@media (min-width: 577px) and (max-width: 1199px) {

    .legal-page {
        max-width: 90%;
        margin: 30px auto;
        padding: 35px 35px;
    }

    .legal-page h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
    }

    .legal-page h4 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .legal-page p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }
}

/* MOBILE STYLING */
@media (max-width: 576px) {

    .legal-page {
        width: auto;
        margin: 18px 12px;
        padding: 24px 20px;
        border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .legal-page h1 {
        font-size: 1.9rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .legal-page .text-muted {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

    .legal-page h4 {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        margin-top: 22px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .legal-page p {
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
}

</style>


<div class="legal-page">

<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: November 2026</p>

    <p>Welcome to Wanderlust. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use and protect information when you use our website.</p>

    <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
    <p>We may collect information such as your name, email address, account details and information you provide when creating or managing listings.</p>

    <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
    <p>We use your information to manage user accounts, provide website features, improve our services and communicate important updates.</p>

    <h4>3. Cookies</h4>
    <p>Wanderlust may use cookies and similar technologies to maintain login sessions and improve your browsing experience.</p>

    <h4>4. Information Sharing</h4>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information. Information may be shared with service providers when necessary to operate website features.</p>

    <h4>5. Data Security</h4>
    <p>We take reasonable measures to protect user information. However, no online platform can guarantee complete security.</p>


    
    <h4>6. Third-Party Services</h4>
    <p>Our website may use third-party services such as Cloudinary and Mapbox to provide image hosting and location-related features. Their own privacy policies may apply.</p>

    <h4>7. Changes to This Policy</h4>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when necessary. Any changes will be published on this page.</p>

    <h4>8. Contact Us</h4>
    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the Wanderlust website administrator.</p>
</div>

</div>